  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#api-for-a-and-area-elements\n\n> If element's url is null or its non-relative flag is set, terminate these steps.\n\nAfter trying to implement this in jsdom, it seems much more likely that the following was intended:\n\n> If element's url is not null, and element's url's non-relative flag is set, terminate these steps.\n\nOtherwise, elements with null urls never get reinitialized.\n",
